<title>DUBAI: Aramco cuts A-960 bunker fuels by $3 a tonne.</title>
<headline>Aramco cuts A-960 bunker fuels by $3 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco on Wednesday cut A-960 bunker fuel oil from Gulf ports to $122 a tonne ($18.73 a barrel) and to $126 ($19.34) from the Red Sea, each down $3.</p>
<p>A-888 bunker diesel from all ports is unchanged at $225.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom +971 4 601255</p>
</text>
